@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Exact metadata backports
+
+The portable patch release supplies reproduction instructions, benchmark
+records, and licenses in its README and profiles.
+
+`DS41_NATIVE_METADATA` is an absolute path to the published proof.
+`DS41_NATIVE_METADATA_PREFILL=1` enables direct dictionary NAX prefill.
+`DS41_NATIVE_GATE_UP=1` enables the separate ordinary-layout paired profile.
+Pairing and exact metadata do not stack.
+
+The loader validates published content identity while retaining file identities
+through each load; copied files may have new modification times.
